{"words": [{"text": "يَوْمَ", "translation": "(On the) day"}, {"text": "تَجِدُ", "translation": "will find"}, {"text": "كُلُّ", "translation": "every"}, {"text": "نَفْسٍۢ", "translation": "soul"}, {"text": "مَّا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "عَمِلَتْ", "translation": "it did"}, {"text": "مِنْ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "خَيْرٍۢ", "translation": "good "}, {"text": "مُّحْضَرًۭا", "translation": "presented"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and what"}, {"text": "عَمِلَتْ", "translation": "it did"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "سُوٓءٍۢ", "translation": "evil"}, {"text": "تَوَدُّ", "translation": "it will wish"}, {"text": "لَوْ", "translation": "[if]"}, {"text": "أَنَّ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "بَيْنَهَا", "translation": "between itself"}, {"text": "وَبَيْنَهُۥٓ", "translation": "and between it (evil)"}, {"text": "أَمَدًۢا", "translation": "(was) a distance"}, {"text": "بَعِيدًۭا ۗ", "translation": "great"}, {"text": "وَيُحَذِّرُكُمُ", "translation": "And warns you"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "نَفْسَهُۥ ۗ", "translation": "(against) Himself"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "and Allah"}, {"text": "رَءُوفٌۢ", "translation": "(is) Most Kind"}, {"text": "بِٱلْعِبَادِ", "translation": "to (His) [the] slaves"}], "sahih": "The Day every soul will find what it has done of good present [before it] and what it has done of evil, it will wish that between itself and that [evil] was a great distance. And Allāh warns you of Himself, and Allāh is Kind to [His] servants.\""}